    <CC_Playground_stack_Title>Stack</CC_Playground_stack_Title>
    <CC_Playground_stack_What>Natural-height vertical stack. Each child gets its declared height; the stack exposes the total.</CC_Playground_stack_What>
    <CC_Playground_stack_When>Use when you need scrollable content made of variable-height panels. Wrap in ScrollArea.</CC_Playground_stack_When>
    <CC_Playground_card_Title>Card</CC_Playground_card_Title>
    <CC_Playground_card_What>Filled rectangular container with padding, background, and border.</CC_Playground_card_What>
    <CC_Playground_card_When>Group related controls. Default surface for a labeled section or demo cell.</CC_Playground_card_When>
    <CC_Playground_heading_Title>Heading</CC_Playground_heading_Title>
    <CC_Playground_heading_What>Typographic heading at levels 1-4. Level controls size and weight.</CC_Playground_heading_What>
    <CC_Playground_heading_When>Title a section. Match the level to the section's depth, not its importance.</CC_Playground_heading_When>
    <CC_Playground_button_Title>Button</CC_Playground_button_Title>
    <CC_Playground_button_What>Primary interactive trigger. Fires a callback on click.</CC_Playground_button_What>
    <CC_Playground_button_When>Use for discrete actions. Reach for ButtonIcon for icon-only actions in tight space.</CC_Playground_button_When>
    <CC_Playground_textfield_Title>TextField</CC_Playground_textfield_Title>
    <CC_Playground_textfield_What>Single-line text entry. Fires onSubmit on Enter and onBlur on focus loss.</CC_Playground_textfield_What>
    <CC_Playground_textfield_When>Collect a short string. Reach for SearchField when you want live filtering on keystroke.</CC_Playground_textfield_When>
    <CC_Playground_spinner_Title>Spinner</CC_Playground_spinner_Title>
    <CC_Playground_spinner_What>Rotating arc that indicates an ongoing operation.</CC_Playground_spinner_What>
    <CC_Playground_spinner_When>Use for operations taking longer than about half a second. Shorter than that, just update the UI.</CC_Playground_spinner_When>
    <CC_Playground_tabs_Title>Tabs</CC_Playground_tabs_Title>
    <CC_Playground_tabs_What>Horizontal row of tabs selecting which of several panels is visible.</CC_Playground_tabs_What>
    <CC_Playground_tabs_When>Use to split a surface into peer views. Prefer tabs over stacked modal dialogs.</CC_Playground_tabs_When>
    <CC_Playground_modal_Title>Modal</CC_Playground_modal_Title>
    <CC_Playground_modal_What>Floating panel that captures focus and dims the background.</CC_Playground_modal_What>
    <CC_Playground_modal_When>Use for decisions that must be made before proceeding. Avoid stacking modals.</CC_Playground_modal_When>
    <CC_Playground_list_Title>List</CC_Playground_list_Title>
    <CC_Playground_list_What>Virtualized scrollable list of rows rendered by a per-item callback.</CC_Playground_list_What>
    <CC_Playground_list_When>Use for long collections. Reach for Table when rows share a columnar structure.</CC_Playground_list_When>
    <CC_Playground_usestate_Title>UseState</CC_Playground_usestate_Title>
    <CC_Playground_usestate_What>Per-render state hook. Returns a handle with a Value getter and Set method.</CC_Playground_usestate_What>
    <CC_Playground_usestate_When>Use whenever a primitive needs to remember something across renders.</CC_Playground_usestate_When>
</LanguageData>
